      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ちょっとな。\r\n情報屋に聞きたい話があって。",
        "official_en": "Just some business. There’s an old gal who trades in info I want to see there.",
        "real_en": "Just some business. There's an information broker in the slums I want to talk to."
